# Browser extension (frontend/extensions/)

- There is **one** extension folder: `QE-Extension-Dev/` (Chromium: Chrome, Edge, Brave). Safari / Xcode copies were removed.
- When behaviour changes, bump `"version"` in `QE-Extension-Dev/manifest.json` and in `frontend/extensions/README.md`.
- Chrome may create `_metadata/` locally — do not commit it; it is generated.
- No secrets or API keys in the extension. The app passes `returnUrl` at runtime. Manak PDFs upload to the functions service at `/api/osl/manak-pdf`.
- Allowed app origins (localhost, `*.qengineering.in`) are listed in the README. Keep the manifest and README consistent when you change them.
- Portal content scripts target `manakonline.in`, `lims.bis.gov.in`, `standards.bis.gov.in` and `standardsbis.bsbedge.com`. Keep selectors defensive, because portal markup changes.
